  "works an empty store anyway": "with keys enumerated rather than computed, an empty store yields no names, so the loop never runs and the count stays zero. The guard says do not touch an empty store and is kept for that, not because it is observable",
  "counts asking, not losing": "clearing by prefix only names a key it has just seen, so what was asked for and what was lost are the same number. They differed before the prefix rewrite"
